  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2517:11",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "神社から出ている桜の《気》は{n}本当は、まっすぐ進むはずだった。",
  "en": "The cherry tree's spiritual energy{n}comes from the shrine.{page}It was supposed to go straight ahead.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2517:12",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "でも、わたしのマンションにぶつかって{n}町中に広がってしまった。",
  "en": "But it hit my apartment tower{n}and spread all over town.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2517:13",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "本当なら、桜の《気》は桐谷町に{n}届くはずだったの。",
  "en": "The cherry tree's spiritual energy{n}was supposed to reach Kiriya.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2517:14",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "だから、一緒に桐谷町へ{n}行って欲しいの。",
  "en": "That's why I want you{n}to come to Kiriya with me.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2517:15",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "それを{var_EF}{slot}{slot}{slot}{slot}{slot}くんに{n}言いたかったの。",
  "en": "That's what I wanted to tell you,{n}{var_EF}{slot}{slot}{slot}{slot}{slot}-kun.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2517:16",
  "hdr": "000B 0011",
