  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "桜。元気をなくした桜。{n}その桜を元気にしてあげればいいのよ！",
  "en": "A cherry tree. It's grown weak.{n}We just need to make it healthy again!",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
